


translate simplified_chinese a00_op_02_c0d55098:



    voice "FUM_0001"
    fumi "在我六岁的平安夜那天，我见到了天使。那年的圣诞节，是这个镇上少有的白色圣诞节。" (what_first_indent=24, show_name=False)


translate simplified_chinese a00_op_02_c238f260:



    voice "FUM_0002"
    fumi "那天傍晚，我在父亲工作的西点店取了圣诞蛋糕后走上了回家之路。" (what_first_indent=24, show_name=False)


translate simplified_chinese a00_op_02_9b5d4290:



    voice "FUM_0003"
    fumi "路上的积雪踩一脚就哗哗地陷下去，这让我很开心。" (what_first_indent=24, show_name=False)


translate simplified_chinese a00_op_02_670c836a:



    voice "FUM_0004"
    fumi "忽然我停下了脚步。鞋子不见了一只。看来是掉在积雪里了。" (what_first_indent=24, show_name=False)


translate simplified_chinese a00_op_02_a2f9c34b:



    voice "FUM_0005"
    fumi "这双鞋子是去年的圣诞节礼物，我非常喜欢。" (what_first_indent=24, show_name=False)


translate simplified_chinese a00_op_02_0a1bac03:



    voice "FUM_0006"
    fumi "看来不该在下雪天穿这么心爱的鞋子吧。但是对那个时候我来说，去父亲的西点店就像去城堡一样。" (what_first_indent=24, show_name=False)


translate simplified_chinese a00_op_02_bdd04a58:



    voice "FUM_0007"
    fumi "周围慢慢变暗，我渐渐不安起来。泪水马上就要夺眶而出。" (what_first_indent=24, show_name=False)


translate simplified_chinese a00_op_02_c999293f:



    voice "FUM_0008"
    fumi "循着声音抬头看去，那里——有一位天使。" (what_first_indent=24, show_name=False)


translate simplified_chinese a00_op_02_3e22ea43:



    voice "FUM_0009"
    fumi "天使指着脚下。雪中能隐约看到红色鞋子的后跟。我跑过去，把鞋子捡起来。" (what_first_indent=24, show_name=False)


translate simplified_chinese a00_op_02_1fff0d34:



    voice "FUM_0010"
    fumi "谢谢——但是当我抬起头来，天使已经不见了。" (what_first_indent=24, show_name=False)
